BT 1 0 0 1 0 109.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (For this project, I wanted to look at whether housing prices are likely to go up or down based on) Tj T* (economic factors such as mortgage rates, unemployment, and inflation. I focused on the 15) Tj T* (largest U.S. metropolitan areas and looked at whether these factors relate to home price changes) Tj T* (differently across each one. Specifically, I'm asking: can mortgage rates, unemployment, and) Tj T* (inflation predict whether home prices in a given metro area will rise or fall the following month, and) Tj T* (do these factors matter more in some metro areas than others? Homebuyers, investors, and) Tj T* (lenders all want to know where the housing market is headed before making big financial) Tj T* (decisions, so this project explores whether economic indicators can actually help answer that.) Tj T* ET
Q
