1 0 0 1 78 313.8 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 94.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (Housing affordability and price swings have become a bigger concern for households and) Tj T* (policymakers in recent years. The 2008 financial crisis showed how closely home values are tied) Tj T* (to broader economic conditions, especially mortgage lending and interest rates. More recently,) Tj T* (home prices jumped sharply from 2020 to 2022, then cooled off as mortgage rates climbed. That) Tj T* (kind of volatility is part of what made me want to look at whether economic indicators can actually) Tj T* (explain or predict these shifts. For buyers, sellers, and lenders, knowing whether a market is) Tj T* (trending up or down has real financial consequences, which is what makes this worth studying.) Tj T* ET
