BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (I combined two data sources for this project. The Federal Reserve Economic Data \(FRED\) API) Tj T* (gave me monthly mortgage rate, unemployment rate, and inflation \(CPI\) data at the national level.) Tj T* (Zillow's Home Value Index \(ZHVI\) gave me monthly home value data for the 15 metro areas I'm) Tj T* (focusing on.) Tj T* ET
